---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Property Operations SMS Consent | Lu Zhang"
  description="How to opt in to Lu Zhang's non-marketing property operations SMS support."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; max-width: 820px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Property Operations SMS</span>
    <h1>SMS Consent</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Lu Zhang's rental operations program, identified in messages as
      <strong>Lu's Property Management</strong>, uses automated text messages
      only for non-marketing property operations support for existing tenants
      and service vendors. This includes maintenance, repairs, lease and
      parking questions, appointments, rental questions, and vendor scheduling.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Opt In</h2>
    <p>
      Existing tenants and service vendors may receive property operations text
      messages by texting <strong>START</strong> to
      <strong>+1 (630) 407-1314</strong>. By sending START, you agree to
      receive transactional text messages from Lu's Property Management about
      your property support request. Consent is not a condition of renting or
      receiving property management services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. This program
      does not send marketing or promotional messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Sample Confirmation</h2>
    <p>
      Lu's Property Management: You are subscribed to property management
      messages about maintenance, repairs, leases, parking, appointments, and
      rental questions. Msg frequency varies. Msg &amp; data rates may apply.
      Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.
    </p>

    <h2>Help and Opt Out</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. Reply <strong>STOP</strong>
      to stop receiving messages. Reply <strong>START</strong> to subscribe
      again after opting out.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy and Terms</h2>
    <p>
      Read the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and
      <a href="/terms/">SMS Terms and Conditions</a>. SMS opt-in data and
      consent are not shared with third parties for marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For support or questions about this program, email
      <a href="mailto:zhanglu77@gmail.com">zhanglu77@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
